Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.94,0:00:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.84,0:00:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.70,0:00:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.22,0:01:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.98,0:01:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.76,0:01:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until someone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.20,0:01:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through all the trouble and times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.58,0:01:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.90,0:01:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.16,0:01:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you\Nif you want to be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.36,0:01:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.72,0:01:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're a pirate?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.05,0:01:54.76,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,798)\blur0.5\fad(978,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2\1a&HFF&\t(936,978,\1a&H00&)}Pirate Commodore Don Krieg
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.05,0:01:54.76,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,798)\blur0.5\fad(978,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Pirate Commodore Don Krieg
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.84,0:01:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.80,0:01:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that why you went and did a crazy thing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.60,0:01:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like shoot a cannonball\Ninto the restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.90,0:02:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.04,0:02:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was self-defense that\Nturned into a stray shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.72,0:02:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stray shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.62,0:02:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In any case, you really don't want\Nto do anything stupid to this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.74,0:02:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The owner used to be a cook\Nin a famous pirate fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.74,0:02:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so the old man used to be a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The restaurant is everything\Nto that crazy old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.74,0:02:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only treasure he'll\Nneed for the rest of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.58,0:02:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll do anything to protect it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.42,0:02:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on top of which all of the\Ncooks who joined him out of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.60,0:02:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,respect and admiration are just\Nas hot-headed as any pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.20,0:02:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which helps, since pirates are always\Ncoming and going out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, notice that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.22,0:02:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a really wild restaurant, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.14,0:02:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.05,0:02:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this is how it is every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.82,0:02:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gotten so bad that\Ncustomers are coming here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just to watch fights between\Nthe cooks and the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.02,0:02:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every day it's been a new\Npirate ship and a new rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't long till all the\Nwaiters got scared and bailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.76,0:02:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's why the old man wanted\Nme to work for him for a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.92,0:03:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you joining my pirate crew or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.20,0:03:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.98,0:03:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a reason I have to\Nwork here in the restaurant,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.18,0:03:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and so I can't just walk away from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.18,0:03:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way! I don't accept!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.18,0:03:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't accept?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.50,0:03:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's very simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.60,0:03:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to accept your refusal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.44,0:03:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a good cook, and I need one,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.00,0:03:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it's obvious that we\Nshould be pirates together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.84,0:03:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.92,0:03:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't leave here, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.12,0:03:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your reason for saying I\Ndon't have to tell you anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.64,0:03:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the but you just\Nsaid to listen to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.68,0:03:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you my answer was no and that's\Nall you need to hear from me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.12,0:03:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take your pirate ship and find a cook\Nsomeplace else before I cut you up, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.06,0:03:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You listen to me, jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.02,0:03:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one makes fun of my Straw Hat\Nunless they're ready for a beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.04,0:03:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to interrupt
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.14,0:03:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.12,0:03:47.08,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,650)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(435,476,\1a&H00&)}Pirate Combatant Gin\NKrieg Pirates
Dialogue: 2,0:03:41.12,0:03:47.08,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,650)\3c&HE7E7E7&\c&HE7E7E7&\1a&HFF&\t(435,476,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Pirate Combatant Gin\NKrieg Pirates
Dialogue: 3,0:03:41.12,0:03:47.08,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,650)\c&HE7E7E7&\4a&HFF&}Pirate Combatant Gin\NKrieg Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.26,0:03:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Gin and I'm a\Ncrew member of Don Krieg's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.94,0:03:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pirate fleet and you say\Nthat you're a pirate yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.58,0:03:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it you seek?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.98,0:03:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.36,0:03:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And pretty soon, I'm going to\Nsail the Grand Line and find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.08,0:03:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you can't have\Nbeen seeking it for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.40,0:04:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't even have a cook yet,\Nyour crew can't be all that big.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.00,0:04:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, he's only the fifth member.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.90,0:04:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you I'm not\Ngoing, so don't count me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.08,0:04:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem like a nice kid, so let me\Ngive you some friendly advice, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.82,0:04:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line is a\Nplace you want to avoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.32,0:04:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still young. There's\Nno need to rush into anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.80,0:04:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, the Grand Line is one\Nsmall part of this entire ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.88,0:04:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to be a real pirate,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.38,0:04:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there are plenty of other places\Nout here on the seas to explore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.24,0:04:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.02,0:04:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, why don't you just tell me\Nwhat to avoid in the Grand Line now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.20,0:04:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.11,0:04:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.66,0:04:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.72,0:04:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that is why I fear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.60,0:04:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For one of Don Krieg's crew members,\Nyou're a pretty wimpy pirate. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.72,0:04:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's Don Krieg?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.94,0:04:56.90,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(477,479)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(435,477,\1a&H00&)\t(4481,4523,\1a&HFF&)}Galley\NSea Restaurant
Dialogue: 2,0:04:51.94,0:04:56.90,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(477,479)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\3c&HE7E7E7&\c&HE7E7E7&\1a&HFF&\t(435,477,\1a&H00&)\t(4481,4523,\1a&HFF&)\4a&HFF&}Galley\NSea Restaurant
Dialogue: 3,0:04:51.94,0:04:56.90,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(477,479)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&HE7E7E7&\4a&HFF&}Galley\NSea Restaurant
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.02,0:04:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The appetizer for table three is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.91,0:04:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're gonna have\Nto take it out yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.56,0:04:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last waiter's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.94,0:05:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think more of them will be coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.00,0:05:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patty. Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.18,0:05:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard the guy you beat up earlier in\Nthe restaurant was one of Don Krieg's men.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.88,0:05:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think that will make\Nthe rest of them very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.28,0:05:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care whose man he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.20,0:05:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I'm saying is the stories I've heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.24,0:05:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,say Don Krieg is the strongest,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.04,0:05:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fiercest, and most evil pirate\Nin this part of the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.52,0:05:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.68,0:05:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On these waters, his grip of\Nfear reaches far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.28,0:05:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He commands over 50 pirate captains, one\Nof the largest pirate fleets ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is truly a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.08,0:05:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.90,0:05:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard that his extraordinary fleet\Nof ships has more than 5,000 pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.34,0:05:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This could be bad for boss if\Nthat guy you beat up goes to Don.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,krieg and tells him what you did\Nand he sends just one ship there
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.10,0:05:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,won't be enough of us to fight\Nthem off we'll be crushed like a
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.62,0:06:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,grape under an elephant and left\Nto sink to the bottom of the ocean
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.00,0:06:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're saying i should\Nhave just served them so
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.98,0:06:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we could experience our\Ngreat customer service
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.12,0:06:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and meals for free you\Ndon't think that would have
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.40,0:06:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,been rude to the other\Ndamn crooks who pay money
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.94,0:06:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would never stoop that\Nlow This is the Baratier The
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.96,0:06:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fighting cooks have a\Nreputation to uphold Don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.18,0:06:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd never ruin that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.42,0:06:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care who that pirate cries to!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.30,0:06:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let them send their ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fight them all off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.80,0:06:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're scared, quit and\Nlet the real cooks work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.38,0:06:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare say that to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.86,0:06:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of all the\Nbig talk you spit out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.90,0:06:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is why all the waiters jumped ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.72,0:06:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything that's happening now\Nis all your fault, Patty? Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.84,0:06:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those waiters were worthless wimps\Nthe moment a customer showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worthless whips!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.06,0:06:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.30,0:06:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take him out, Carney!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.88,0:06:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't stand a chance, Patty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.42,0:06:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, what's all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.36,0:06:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back to work already!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.20,0:06:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, boss, Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.34,0:06:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.04,0:07:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the warning, but I'm\Nstill gonna go to the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.92,0:07:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.83,0:07:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.22,0:07:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just a stranger, and I can't stop you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from going anywhere you want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to give you a fair warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.64,0:07:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to you, chef?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.70,0:07:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything you saved\Nmy life and I owe you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.54,0:07:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your cooking skills are\Nthe best I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.76,0:07:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope to come back again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.20,0:07:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have a seat for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.18,0:07:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.26,0:07:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.50,0:07:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss, you're hard to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.78,0:07:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Gain? Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.70,0:07:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.84,0:07:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll probably get yelled at or fired?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.46,0:07:41.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because you gave me that food for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.62,0:07:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.18,0:07:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now there's not proof, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.52,0:07:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way for me to get yelled at.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.18,0:08:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try not to get caught again, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.90,0:08:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you again, Chef Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.84,0:08:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will never forget your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.98,0:08:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.44,0:08:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back to work already!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.86,0:08:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.77,0:08:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Table 3 is ready!
