Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.22,0:08:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.13,0:08:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Luffy and I'm gonna\Nbe the new Chorboy around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.46,0:08:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet all of you!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.36,0:08:29.24,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(438,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(396,438,\1a&H00&)}On Hiatus From Piracy
