Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one of us was supposed to make that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.34,0:08:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was supposed to be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.92,0:08:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to make that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.44,0:08:49.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm too busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.35,0:08:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're too busy being injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.96,0:08:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say that again. I dare you.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.97,0:08:54.68,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&}On Hiatus From Piracy
Dialogue: 2,0:08:52.97,0:08:54.68,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\3c&HE7E7E7&\c&HE7E7E7&\4a&HFF&}On Hiatus From Piracy
Dialogue: 3,0:08:52.97,0:08:54.68,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&HE7E7E7&\4a&HFF&}On Hiatus From Piracy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.90,0:08:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you sit there picking your nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.88,0:08:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go wash the dishes or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.58,0:08:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.76,0:09:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has anyone seen Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.06,0:09:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I saw him hitting on a customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.10,0:09:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.01,0:09:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish Boss Zef would get rid of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.78,0:09:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's bad enough he's the Zeus chef, but\Nhe's never in the kitchen doing his job.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.62,0:09:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we're stuck with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.28,0:09:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's worked here longer than any of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.14,0:09:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was working the kitchen and the\Ndining room even before I started.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.70,0:09:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but even so, I just don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.08,0:09:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does he stay here when he\Nand Boss Zephyr always fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.30,0:09:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he wants to be the head chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.10,0:09:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.86,0:09:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chore boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.84,0:09:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just how many of these dishes have\Nyou gone and broken into tiny pieces?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.66,0:09:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.78,0:09:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot to count! Aw, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't being serious, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.82,0:09:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you breaking them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.16,0:09:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop screwing around\Nand clean up your mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.14,0:09:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.06,0:09:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't take the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.48,0:09:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.78,0:09:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a perfect entree!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, pretty tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.46,0:10:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we have you take\Norders in the dining room?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.78,0:10:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just ask the customers\Nwhat they want to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.06,0:10:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that simple enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.58,0:10:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.54,0:10:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These chores sure are boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.90,0:10:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Kobe got tired\Nof all this work, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.44,0:10:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chore boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.62,0:10:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.53,0:10:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.56,0:10:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We heard you had to work\Nhere for a whole year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.70,0:10:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that okay if we redraw\Nthe flag for our ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.36,0:10:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're eating all this\Ndelicious food without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.98,0:10:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of crew are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.52,0:10:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who could you do this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.04,0:10:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.95,0:10:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that's our\Nbusiness, isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.08,0:10:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this. Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.00,0:10:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is going to be so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.40,0:10:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I have to say the food\Nhere really is quite delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.54,0:10:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.72,0:10:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.68,0:10:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel bad for you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.32,0:10:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be drinking this yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.88,0:10:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you did that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.28,0:10:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I can't believe you did that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.76,0:11:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was nasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.32,0:11:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't they quaint?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if that's the rest of his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.84,0:11:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finish pouring it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.82,0:11:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear Ocean, thank you for this treasure\Nyou have shared from your depths. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.16,0:11:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.94,0:11:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't bear this hardship\Nof loving you from afar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.54,0:11:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is too difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.06,0:11:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am now prepared to sail to the\Nends of the earth as a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.36,0:11:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it means someone of your rare beauty?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.26,0:11:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will be by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.42,0:11:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be together sailing the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.98,0:11:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how tragic a great\Nobstacle blocks our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.66,0:11:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That great obstacle would be me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.78,0:11:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.86,0:11:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, stupid geezer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.34,0:11:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an opportunity\Nyou don't want to pass up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.10,0:11:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not join them and become a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.30,0:11:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no need to keep\Nyou here at my restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.80,0:12:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.86,0:12:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This cook saved your life, and you\Nwere able to return here to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.58,0:12:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you're saying, Ginny?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.38,0:12:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but you see, I had no idea the main\Nship was in this condition, Don Krieg.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.36,0:12:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.56,0:12:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.30,0:12:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I believe I'll take you to\Nthe Sea Restaurant, Baratie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.70,0:12:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.32,0:12:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the Zeus chef in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.62,0:12:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean you\Ndon't need me anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.42,0:12:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fight with customers all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.84,0:12:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You flirt with every woman\Nunder 80 who walks through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.94,0:13:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't even cook a decent meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.92,0:13:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're worth less to me\Nthan the chum after brunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.52,0:13:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.70,0:13:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.24,0:13:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and let's not forget about how the other\Ncooks avoid you like you were poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.78,0:13:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So just run off and be a pirate or\Nwhatever, but get out of this restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.00,0:13:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shoot off at the mouth and expect\Nthat I'm just going to take it, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.72,0:13:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could blow off everything you said,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.36,0:13:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I won't listen to anyone trash my\Ncooking I'm staying here as a Zeus chef,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that's final.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.96,0:13:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing\Ngrabbing your boss by the collar?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.88,0:13:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.08,0:13:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,try
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.72,0:13:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to kick me out
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.30,0:13:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm here to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going anywhere, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.36,0:14:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not till you're dead and gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.14,0:14:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.05,0:14:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got another hundred years of\Nkicking your ass left in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.50,0:14:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's always got to have\Nthe last word. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.24,0:14:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said it's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.26,0:14:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you can become a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.50,0:14:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.16,0:14:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.62,0:14:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope I can make it up to you with this\Ndelightful fruit Macedonia, my princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.78,0:14:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.38,0:14:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks wonderful. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.34,0:14:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't forget about us, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.14,0:14:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Casanova.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.05,0:14:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd better get some\Nkind of an apology, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.10,0:14:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This tea should be more\Nthan adequate for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.12,0:14:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, you should be thanking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.90,0:14:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.81,0:14:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.73,0:14:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to regret this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.06,0:14:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take him out, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.66,0:14:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.18,0:14:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.22,0:14:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't fight because of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.72,0:14:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.04,0:14:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who said it was about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.56,0:14:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to tell you that all of\Nthe food here is just delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.18,0:14:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's a little too expensive for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax, it's free!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.50,0:14:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.96,0:14:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys still got to pay, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.38,0:14:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How very generous of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.54,0:15:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you sitting around for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.14,0:15:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not here to lounge around. Right.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.30,0:15:12.47,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(942,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,720)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(900,942,\1a&H00&)}Two Days Later
Dialogue: 2,0:15:08.30,0:15:12.47,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(942,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,720)\3c&HE7E7E7&\c&HE7E7E7&\1a&HFF&\t(900,942,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Two Days Later
Dialogue: 3,0:15:08.30,0:15:12.47,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(942,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,720)\c&HE7E7E7&\4a&HFF&}Two Days Later
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.14,0:15:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.05,0:15:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.97,0:15:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hourglasses mean our time is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.00,0:15:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.38,0:15:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that flag means death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.56,0:15:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.90,0:15:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It belongs to the ruler of the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.86,0:15:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blue Don Krieg!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.66,0:16:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.57,0:16:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why have the creek pirates come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.86,0:16:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.38,0:16:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew those goons would show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.10,0:16:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.01,0:16:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna get rid\Nof those guys or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.22,0:16:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.30,0:16:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a whole fleet to command.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.94,0:16:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would Tang Creek come here\Nto get revenge for just one man?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.56,0:16:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, doesn't he have\Nanything better to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.42,0:16:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's here, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.60,0:16:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not imagining that ship, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.82,0:16:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, don't panic, but I think\Nthis is our cue to leave right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.40,0:16:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at the sheer size of that galleon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.88,0:16:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a huge ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.90,0:16:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think Ginny came back to\Nrepay you for your kindness?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.00,0:16:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I seriously doubt that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.36,0:16:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.18,0:16:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.36,0:17:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's Shanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.98,0:17:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what'd they do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.48,0:17:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sail through a hurricane or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.32,0:17:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem like damage\Ninflicted by cannons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.68,0:17:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, it doesn't look man-made at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.66,0:17:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then maybe it was a tornado hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.32,0:17:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he is.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.87,0:17:44.84,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(523,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(481,523,\1a&H00&)}Don Krieg\NPirate Commodore
Dialogue: 2,0:17:39.87,0:17:44.84,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(523,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\3c&HE7E7E7&\c&HE7E7E7&\1a&HFF&\t(481,523,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Don Krieg\NPirate Commodore
Dialogue: 3,0:17:39.87,0:17:44.84,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(523,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&HE7E7E7&\4a&HFF&}Don Krieg\NPirate Commodore
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.66,0:17:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beg you. I need food and water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.48,0:17:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.26,0:17:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lots of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.04,0:18:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, this can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.22,0:18:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the death and destruction?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.22,0:18:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this really the Don Krieg,\NCommodore of the Grand Pirate Fleet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.16,0:18:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess he's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.40,0:18:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, uh, uh, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.38,0:18:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,C-Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.06,0:18:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Don Krieg!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.88,0:18:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.26,0:18:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our captain is on the brink of starvation!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.70,0:18:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.62,0:18:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hasn't had a single\Nbite to eat for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.42,0:18:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll die if he doesn't\Nget some food soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.54,0:18:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.64,0:18:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't laughed that\Nhard in a long time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.66,0:18:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The great Don Creek kneeling before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.78,0:18:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have some money.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.26,0:18:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here as customers this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.10,0:18:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think I'm that stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.26,0:18:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, get a hold of the Marines right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.56,0:18:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.47,0:18:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's finally weak enough to be captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.52,0:18:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This may never happen again,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.72,0:19:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm not going to ruin it by\Nhelping him get his strength back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.74,0:19:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.65,0:19:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows what he'll do if\Nhe gets on his feet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.78,0:19:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's done terrible things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.62,0:19:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as soon as he's up,\Nhe'll keep on doing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.98,0:19:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we let him starve.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.30,0:19:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once he's back to normal, he'll kill\Nevery last person in this restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.36,0:19:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't get so much as\Na glass of water from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.48,0:19:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.76,0:19:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.62,0:19:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I eat, I promise I'll leave quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.30,0:19:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So please, be merciful and help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.68,0:19:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a king, Don Krieg. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.22,0:19:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't reduce yourself to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.34,0:19:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're better than a\Ncommon beggar, please sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.76,0:19:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about your pride?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.36,0:19:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've promised
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.90,0:19:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please I'll take the scraps.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.82,0:19:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.40,0:19:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.54,0:19:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.24,0:20:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, boo-hoo for the cruel\Npirate. Hey, move it, Paddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.08,0:20:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.28,0:20:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's something for your captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.84,0:20:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.02,0:20:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.24,0:20:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dimwit! Get that food\Naway from him right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.32,0:20:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize he's a cold\Nheartless killing machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.24,0:20:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the man known as the ruler of the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.64,0:20:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,east blue the most\Ntreacherous of all pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.86,0:21:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all started back in prison he pretended
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.26,0:21:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to be a marine and when\Nhe decided to declare
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.84,0:21:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his pirate ambitions he took command of a
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.26,0:21:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,marine vessel by killing\Nthe senior officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.18,0:21:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He would raise the marine\Nflag to enter ports!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.98,0:21:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then lay waste to the unsuspecting\Ncities and passenger ships there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.76,0:21:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He even showed the white flag\Nbefore attacking enemy ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.96,0:21:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did anything to secure victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.54,0:21:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy fights dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.46,0:21:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's also unmatched in physical combat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.34,0:21:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think he'll just leave us alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.80,0:21:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I've got news for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.60,0:21:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not possible with a\Nbloodthirsty killer like him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.18,0:21:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He deserves death!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.64,0:21:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.16,0:21:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.18,0:22:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is not what we agreed on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.60,0:22:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gave me your word.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.14,0:22:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only brought you here because you\Npromised that you wouldn't ruin this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.28,0:22:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or hurt the man who saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.54,0:22:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that was delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.14,0:22:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel alive again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.20,0:22:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.76,0:22:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.32,0:22:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think is going on in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.24,0:22:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.15,0:22:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go inside and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.07,0:22:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.98,0:22:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.52,0:22:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a pretty good ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.28,0:22:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe that I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.46,0:23:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.37,0:23:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.44,0:23:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you can all see, my ship is a wreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.84,0:23:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naturally, I'll be needing a nice new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.34,0:23:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After a few small chores, every last one\Nof you will leave the ship. What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.28,0:23:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg, you promised! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.78,0:23:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are about a hundred\Nmen left on board my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.26,0:23:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All are weak with hunger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.18,0:23:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And many are seriously wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.48,0:23:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you value your lives, you will prepare\Nfood and water for every last one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.14,0:23:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've lost too many men to hunger already.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.44,0:23:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.00,0:23:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring them over! Immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.72,0:24:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're telling us to\Nfeed our executioners?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.70,0:24:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hear how stupid that sounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.86,0:24:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.70,0:24:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.84,0:24:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jews, I wasn't asking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.52,0:24:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now make no mistake, you wretched cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.12,0:24:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not placing an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.02,0:24:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am giving you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.90,0:24:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I make myself clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.60,0:24:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't defy me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.12,0:24:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.56,0:24:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.60,0:24:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean for this to happen. You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.98,0:24:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look what you brought on this\Nrestaurant you stupid bastard
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.08,0:24:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.84,0:25:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the kitchen
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.88,0:25:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I'll be cooking\Na hundred more meals today.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.04,0:25:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.18,0:25:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.09,0:25:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.54,0:25:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.45,0:25:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hop to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.42,0:25:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me the truth, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.08,0:25:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you his spy or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.50,0:25:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let you go\Nanywhere near that kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.92,0:25:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're fed up with you acting insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.42,0:25:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.64,0:25:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop me if you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.12,0:25:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.46,0:25:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no secret that Don Krieg\Nis a terrible, ruthless man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.58,0:25:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.82,0:25:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.84,0:25:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After we feed all these men, who\Nknows what's going to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.22,0:25:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am just a simple cook,\Nno more and no less.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.38,0:26:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If someone's going hungry,\Nit's my duty to feed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.90,0:26:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.80,0:26:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.88,0:26:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.26,0:26:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Penny!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.36,0:26:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, somebody grab him!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.10,0:26:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bring free food to the bums I kick\Nout of this place over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.06,0:26:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm not about to argue over who's\Nright in that particular situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.66,0:26:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but this time you're just\Nflat out wrong, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.68,0:26:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let you do\Nthings like that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.60,0:26:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to protect this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.82,0:26:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, we've got\Nnumbers on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.32,0:26:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is Don Krieg, but what\Ncould he do against all of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.14,0:26:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At a joint like this, pirate\Nscumbags come and go all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.22,0:26:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're fully prepared to\Nserve any kind of customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.78,0:26:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.76,0:26:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really hope you saved\Nsome room for dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.98,0:27:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause I have a secret recipe. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.64,0:27:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is truly to die for!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.14,0:27:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.22,0:27:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes the meatball of doom!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.48,0:27:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.50,0:27:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might have broken the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.60,0:27:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure hope Zef doesn't yell at me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.96,0:27:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They might go easy on you for\Nsaving the restaurant and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.44,0:27:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what are we going to do about\Nall the guys left in Krieg's ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.58,0:27:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fry them!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.49,0:27:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cover it and batter and\Nfry the entire thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.40,0:27:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you a chef or a comedian?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.70,0:27:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because your jokes are lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.94,0:27:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that dessert was terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.86,0:28:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The worst I ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.84,0:28:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So die!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.60,0:28:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got them everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.64,0:28:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All those guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.32,0:28:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cooks should not have defied me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.56,0:28:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am by far the world's strongest man!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.04,0:28:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arms made of solid steel,\Nwood-steel body armor, impenetrable?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.44,0:28:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and a diamond fist that can\Npound this entire world to dust!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.12,0:28:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in addition to the weapons\Non my body I have a
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.64,0:28:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fleet of 50 ships with\N5,000 pirates my record is
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.86,0:28:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,perfect I've won every\Nsingle battle that I've
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.56,0:29:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ever been in I am Don and\NI'm the only one fit to be
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.34,0:29:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,called Don out of the way
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.24,0:29:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when I give you slime balls
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.88,0:29:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in order you will follow\Nit down to the last ladder
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.28,0:29:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't ever disobey me this
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.06,0:29:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is about a hundred meals
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.76,0:29:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now take it to your men\Nright away. No owner Zeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.02,0:29:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're redfoot Zeff
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.66,0:29:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what are you doing you can't\Nbe serious if all of those
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.16,0:29:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pirates get their strength\Nback the restaurant will be
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.42,0:29:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,completely taken over that\Nwould be true if they still
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.48,0:29:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,had the will to fight tell me\Ndid your will survive defeat
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.04,0:30:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be the great Don Kaido was\Ndefeated. Oh, not even he could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.68,0:30:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pirate fleet with 50\Nships couldn't make it
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.86,0:30:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on the Grand Line the Grand\NLine it It is you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.94,0:30:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Redfoot Zeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.20,0:30:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a kid, I never stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.88,0:30:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Searching for a great treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.46,0:30:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a map in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.24,0:30:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I knew would lead me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.84,0:30:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to find my way to that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.06,0:30:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before someone could beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.94,0:30:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The promised land was in my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.14,0:30:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.56,0:30:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.08,0:30:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stop chasing
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.20,0:31:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it until it comes true.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.56,0:31:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the world ever changes?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.34,0:31:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call out your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.46,0:31:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We return to the time when\Neverything's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.40,0:31:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you,\Nmy memories won't fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.82,0:31:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting for that one true dream.

